{"4369660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms Not Escape", "steam_appid": 4369660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Not Escape is a multiplayer survival horror game with voice chat, beautiful graphics, and <strong>8 (9) engaging levels</strong> with unique mechanics. You and three friends must find the exit from each level to reach reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/e1514d13d9e0eb060f820cf5712f3a9d.avif?t=1771623068\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mechanic and level is a unique adventure for you and your friends, with unique gameplay, collectibles, and monsters creating a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/24be4a8b1d15d704db13dce5a90d330e.avif?t=1771623068\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/30118fc01b59eadedd1022c1bf67f390.poster.avif?t=1771623068\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/30118fc01b59eadedd1022c1bf67f390.webm?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/30118fc01b59eadedd1022c1bf67f390.mp4?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is an interesting puzzle with its own mechanics. During early access, new levels and entities will be added almost every week, so we hope that it will become one of the best games in the <u>Backrooms</u> universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/eec534317323c5273ddbed7b983f53fd.avif?t=1771623068\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/b096b94045b798f4bcf9358d3c1b0f2f.poster.avif?t=1771623068\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/b096b94045b798f4bcf9358d3c1b0f2f.webm?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/b096b94045b798f4bcf9358d3c1b0f2f.mp4?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>8(9) levels</i> with interesting features and tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 interesting and unique <i>monsters</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an accounting system and about <i>15 unique items</i>, as well as random spawning of items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiplayer for 2 to 4 players</i>, and there is also a solo mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/4ad62bbea201a66d5880b1ab296cacb0.avif?t=1771623068\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/c3b37004f7f46ad22510479de8a88950.poster.avif?t=1771623068\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/c3b37004f7f46ad22510479de8a88950.webm?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/c3b37004f7f46ad22510479de8a88950.mp4?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built on the Unity engine with a multiplayer system based on Photon Pun 2, allowing you and your friends to fully immerse yourself in the atmosphere and lore of Backrooms. We're paying special attention to the lore of the backrooms, but we can't promise it will be exactly the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Not Escape is a multiplayer survival horror game with voice chat, beautiful graphics, and <strong>8 (9) engaging levels</strong> with unique mechanics. You and three friends must find the exit from each level to reach reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/e1514d13d9e0eb060f820cf5712f3a9d.avif?t=1771623068\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mechanic and level is a unique adventure for you and your friends, with unique gameplay, collectibles, and monsters creating a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/24be4a8b1d15d704db13dce5a90d330e.avif?t=1771623068\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/30118fc01b59eadedd1022c1bf67f390.poster.avif?t=1771623068\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/30118fc01b59eadedd1022c1bf67f390.webm?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/30118fc01b59eadedd1022c1bf67f390.mp4?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is an interesting puzzle with its own mechanics. During early access, new levels and entities will be added almost every week, so we hope that it will become one of the best games in the <u>Backrooms</u> universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/eec534317323c5273ddbed7b983f53fd.avif?t=1771623068\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/b096b94045b798f4bcf9358d3c1b0f2f.poster.avif?t=1771623068\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/b096b94045b798f4bcf9358d3c1b0f2f.webm?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/b096b94045b798f4bcf9358d3c1b0f2f.mp4?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>8(9) levels</i> with interesting features and tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 interesting and unique <i>monsters</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an accounting system and about <i>15 unique items</i>, as well as random spawning of items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiplayer for 2 to 4 players</i>, and there is also a solo mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/4ad62bbea201a66d5880b1ab296cacb0.avif?t=1771623068\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/c3b37004f7f46ad22510479de8a88950.poster.avif?t=1771623068\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/c3b37004f7f46ad22510479de8a88950.webm?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/extras/c3b37004f7f46ad22510479de8a88950.mp4?t=1771623068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built on the Unity engine with a multiplayer system based on Photon Pun 2, allowing you and your friends to fully immerse yourself in the atmosphere and lore of Backrooms. We're paying special attention to the lore of the backrooms, but we can't promise it will be exactly the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Backrooms: Not Escape is a multiplayer horror game for 4 players with interesting mechanics that will allow you to have fun with your friends. Never enter the backrooms alone. Explore them and find a way out, but there is no guarantee that it exists.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369660/9be99828291e80997113efcfdc30831889fb1098/header.jpg?t=1771623068", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s